### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `action` | `Function` | `undefined` | The async function to execute when clicked. |
| `variant` | `String` | `'default'` | The visual variant of the button. |
| `size` | `String` | `'default'` | The size of the button. |
| `loading` | `Boolean` | `false` | Manually control the loading state. |
| `disabled` | `Boolean` | `false` | Disable the button. |

### Slots

| Slot | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| `default` | The content of the button. |
| `icon` | An optional icon to display. |

